uiD.readme:
Window {0} made in MyAceEditor (Interfaces > Create interface).

HOW TO USE IT IN THE GAME
The game only opens windows it already knows, and links each one to its code by name:
1. the file name (e.g. version01\gmconsole.xml) picks the window's code;
2. the window name (Win_...) must be the original window's;
3. every control the game uses must exist with the same name and type;
4. every button must have the same Command as the original.
If something is missing, the window does not work or the game closes.

The safe way: open this .zip in MyAceEditor (Create interface > Open) and use "Link to game": it checks everything, brings what is missing and writes to interfaces.pck with a backup.

